woodland 2.1.0

Fixed bugs:
	1. Windowlist activating wrong windows.

	2. Calendar always showing 31 days.

	3. Some GTK apps launching in maximized and fullscreen mode.

	4. QT apps not scaling properly (by adding fractional scaling).

	5. GCC linker could not find local include/

	6. Clicking on menu and windowlist items would activate the windows below.

	7. Transient windows adopting parents sizes.

	8. Popups constraints.

	11. Zooming in/out would resize MPV.

	12. Virtual keyboard input lag.

	13. Closing a window would give focus to the wrong window.

	14. Black right margin while zooming from the right corner.

New features:
	1. Added a quick launcher/applauncher activated by <Super><Space>.

	2. Added icon support for the windowlist.

	3. Added support for icon themes in woodland.ini.

	4. Added default Woodland wallpaper.

	5. Added fractional scale protocol.

	6. Added modal dialogs functionality.

	7. Added possword validation for network applet.

Improvements:
	1. Touchpad (debounce) scrolling and zooming.

	2. Performance and memory consumption.

	3. Better windows centering.

	4. Focusing the proper window on closing.

	5. Minimized windows are now highlighted with light gray italic font.
	
	
